#: view/common/ark-noid-maintenance.phtml:95
msgid ""
"A backup of the noid database is always better than a rebuild: the arks of "
"the resources removed after the last ark stored in Omeka cannot be known, so "
"they may be assigned again to new resources. To avoid it, the rebuild can "
"skip a margin of identifiers after the last ark: they will never be "
"assigned. The only cost is a gap in the numbering."
msgstr ""

#: data/scripts/upgrade.php:79
msgid ""
"It is now possible to define a specific property to store arks. Warning: if "
"you change it, old arks won’t be moved (use module {link}Bulk Edit{link_end} "
"for that)."
msgstr ""
"Il est désormais possible de définir une propriété spécifique pour "
"enregistrer les arks. Attention : si vous la changez, les anciens arks ne "
"seront pas automatiquement déplacés dans la nouvelle propriété (utiliser le "
"module {link}Bulk Edit{link_end} pour cela)."

